# Ollama model catalog — pulled by provision/sync-models.sh.
#
# Format: one model name per line. Blank lines and lines starting with '#'
# are ignored. Anything after a '#' on a line is treated as a comment.
#
# To add a model: append a line and re-run sync-models.sh (it's idempotent —
# `ollama pull` is a no-op if the model is already present).
# To remove a model: delete its line here AND run `ollama rm <model>` by
# hand. provision.sh never removes anything.
#
# Each model serves a gateway role (stack/observability/litellm/config.yaml,
# local/<role>), chosen from measurements: docs/operations/model-refresh-2026-11.md.
# Re-run stack/scripts/eval-local-models.py before replacing one, and
# stack/scripts/update-litellm-config.sh ollama after editing this file.
# Sizes are GPU memory on the RTX 5080 at the role's context (nvidia-smi rise).
#
# Agent models, each with the context it runs at, are in agent-models.list.

qwen2.5-coder:3b                # 2.3 GB    local/fim: tab completion (fill-in-the-middle)
nemotron-3.5-bolt:e4b           # 8.1 GB    local/general and local/reason: summaries, log triage, think it through
gemma4:12b                      # 9.5 GB    local/code: write and edit code (thinking off)
embeddinggemma-2                # 1.9 GB    local/embed: embeddings for retrieval
qwen2.5-coder:14b               # 11.7 GB   pinned by name: fighters-legacy's AI default
